A feature that is a real king-safety signal should be strongest in the midgame and fade — or invert — toward the endgame, where the king wants to be active rather than sheltered.
-> test-results/king-safety-signal-anchor.json

A monotone column means the feature carries information. A column that wanders around 0.5000 means there is nothing to tune, and three failed attempts are explained.
